la for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u+v)=\\sin u\\cos v+\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nApply it and substitute the exact special-angle values:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x+150^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 150^\\circ+\\cos x\\sin 150^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)+\\cos x\\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\sin x+\\frac{1}{2}\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nThe plus sign outside the second blank is supplied. The entries are $-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ and $\\frac{1}{2}$, respectively."] [:db/add "76cbf1ba-ce13-5259-8e41-4eaa55eb4b0b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "76cbf1ba-ce13-5259-8e41-4eaa55eb4b0b" :question/answer-fields "a1b3b6b6-ddf5-5efb-87d3-4ff3be9e602a"] [:db/add "76cbf1ba-ce13-5259-8e41-4eaa55eb4b0b" :question/answer-fields "19179e85-4d40-5bb9-b5b7-17db6ba6325b"] [:db/ensure "76cbf1ba-ce13-5259-8e41-4eaa55eb4b0b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059662 :knowledge-point/questions "76cbf1ba-ce13-5259-8e41-4eaa55eb4b0b"] [:db/add "f7a7ce9f-c9f8-5961-9265-426a1f6ba458" :answer/id #uuid "f7a7ce9f-c9f8-5961-9265-426a1f6ba458"] [:db/add "f7a7ce9f-c9f8-5961-9265-426a1f6ba458" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f7a7ce9f-c9f8-5961-9265-426a1f6ba458" :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}"] [:db/ensure "f7a7ce9f-c9f8-5961-9265-426a1f6ba458" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c6f9c050-5947-59d7-b79b-172232f61c6c" :answer-field/id #uuid "c6f9c050-5947-59d7-b79b-172232f61c6c"] [:db/add "c6f9c050-5947-59d7-b79b-172232f61c6c" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "c6f9c050-5947-59d7-b79b-172232f61c6c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c6f9c050-5947-59d7-b79b-172232f61c6c" :answer-field/choices "f7a7ce9f-c9f8-5961-9265-426a1f6ba458"] [:db/add "c6f9c050-5947-59d7-b79b-172232f61c6c" :answer-field/correct "f7a7ce9f-c9f8-5961-9265-426a1f6ba458"] [:db/ensure "c6f9c050-5947-59d7-b79b-172232f61c6c" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "0735c4c1-2eab-5012-b00e-d99f1aa1b25c" :answer/id #uuid "0735c4c1-2eab-5012-b